### Doctor schedule — with filters
### Run api/auth/login.http first — the jwt variable is captured automatically.
GET http://localhost:8030/consultation/schedule?page=0&size=10
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{jwt}}

{
  "startDate": "2026-04-26T09:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-04-26T18:00:00",
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

###

### Doctor schedule — no filters (returns all slots)
GET http://localhost:8030/consultation/schedule?page=0&size=20
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: jwt={{jwt}}

{}

###
